{"job_id":"F-289c13184038f0e136eb","family_id":"F-289c13184038f0e136eb","title":"외국군인ㆍ군속에 대한 명예계급 수여 규정","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":22,"target_id":"43d08dabe76ce7a0116949f59a36ab5729e841e4cd428f7b21c88e21670c7bd9","source_hash":"2c9e35be879c8760087d76e9516557591e675960f37a8c6231495a5222bf5385","text":"关于授予外国军人和文职人员荣誉军衔的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":55,"target_id":"2d83229884089c2df3e8b744580941f1d1a61cb9ee367efb8bcb9642962f3140","source_hash":"fbca0210c8d47faf0d3b773762a27e358cb497960790f4e94fe0c2b8af0a5ff0","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是规定授予外国军事人员和文职人员荣誉军衔的事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"BODY","start":55,"end":273,"target_id":"6c10a3667cec10e50f045204439f0d70a6749671ee4779d3302f55d0f4752b38","source_hash":"ec3c890310055ac85cb23afba05832cf24d93e5dba0e8253a5de570ae1121ab2","text":"第二条（授予荣誉军衔的资格）\n① 在韩国居住三年以上，并被公认为做出杰出贡献的外国军官或文职人员，可以授予其荣誉军衔。\n② 根据第1款授予的荣誉军衔不得授予将军或以上军衔；授予军官时，军衔应与受封者在其祖国所担任的军衔相同；授予文职人员时，军衔应与受封者在其祖国所受到的待遇相同。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"BODY","start":273,"end":408,"target_id":"1670f0376d002e58b8725eacf2cee61d03a1f8109f6424307393c3907368bc5b","source_hash":"cd769a1595a93f53ca12614a2f91398b8658b5f076a49a5f0fa5041fa2a532c8","text":"第三条（授予荣誉军衔的效力）\n授予荣誉军衔并不赋予在韩国服兵役的权利或义务。\n获得荣誉军衔的人员只有在参加韩国活动时才能穿着韩国军服并佩戴军衔标志。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"BODY","start":408,"end":456,"target_id":"a7c18ebea0c043605dd59d9a9de6acc9d0c9d61991e12f9f4412195d515ee36e","source_hash":"ab32f498205929042d0980c0db76704dc55912e74d77282d4c1b6294c9949a19","text":"第四条（授予证书）授予荣誉军衔时，应按附件格式颁发荣誉军衔授予证书。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"BODY","start":456,"end":477,"target_id":"2c402ae31da8a38455e7bbfe1f1281cbeeab061b37688714bd7eeed6ae0143b2","source_hash":"c54a6d42e114e28b9661c9c794db018405abe69724f03eb329760c7bd7223e8a","text":"第 5 条已删除 <2013.12.17>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"BODY","start":477,"end":521,"target_id":"965e57b041f5cc4a0ed5c2bb2c770a69f59c8a9e4dbf134427dfcf3833233d9a","source_hash":"a0f521a2614c4fe25bbd7d311cca7f980fff860da022adf52477050523d2b5c4","text":"补充规定 <第4936号，1970年4月20日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"BODY","start":521,"end":2300,"target_id":"73b56916370bde4c492b30c084d7e038e664cc834f748a098d87cbe394cbcec6","source_hash":"d5a45ebc100e8b5b0624ad352bd31070c189c6956702f02b2bac0740b6f043d0","text":"补充规定 <第25005号，2013年12月17日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n荣誉军衔授予证书\n■ 授予外国军人和文职人员荣誉军衔的规定[附件] <2013年12月17日修订>         \n\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n┃명예계급 수여장                                                                 ┃\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n┃隶属关系┃\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n┃名称┃\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n┃생년월일                                                                        ┃\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n┃ 致上述人士，依据《外国军事人员和文职人员授予荣誉军衔条例》第二条 ○○ ┃\n\n┃授予荣誉军衔。┃\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n┃                                                                                ┃\n\n"},{"id":"A29746-zh-00001","doc":"A29746","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2175722","source_hash":"8ed99f36d2f70dd9f7a74e2f6797a1d6dacf86b3eda167f0cd0226dad4763e97","text":"■ 授予外国军人和文职人员荣誉军衔的规定 [附件] <2013年12月17日修订>"},{"id":"A29746-zh-00002","doc":"A29746","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2175723","source_hash":"a24e4ef7887e491bee263b84a06354460ed906767e837ed43eaa99ba3f7d59ed","text":"荣誉军衔授予证书"},{"id":"A29746-zh-00003","doc":"A29746","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2175725","source_hash":"27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92ce813f065a748e3dbd5848ae722a38e8bf0441eecccb","text":"子"},{"id":"A29746-zh-00004","doc":"A29746","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2175726","source_hash":"bb35ab6d24daaf2db64eb43bf943f7653ff4f0c84bda2dede78d9ba7680b3f92","text":"名称"},{"id":"A29746-zh-00005","doc":"A29746","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2175727","source_hash":"9f96b8e22cc06bfafc548ef472e33b60548b190f17dbc04b1da176a50d2c6d2c","text":"名称"},{"id":"A29746-zh-00006","doc":"A29746","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2175728","source_hash":"f7ea9e331f80935959d8c179f685fbbdfde7f0301e791106a64b454bb1d6e80c","text":"出生日期"},{"id":"A29746-zh-00007","doc":"A29746","law_id":"kr-004254-148022-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2175729","source_hash":"37d7f6540c49756e99e1c3b3acfaaca1a882315682e61b1813c5cb1da090b07e","text":"致上述人士，依据《授予外国军事人员和文职人员荣誉军衔条例》第二条 ○○"},{"id":"A29